# SchoolConnect Frontend Environment Variables

# Backend API URL (Leave blank in local development to use Vite proxy localhost:5000)
# In production, set to your backend deployment URL, e.g.:
VITE_API_URL=https://schoolconnect-backend.onrender.com

# Backend Socket.IO URL (Leave blank in local development to connect to current host)
# In production, set to your backend deployment URL, e.g.:
VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://schoolconnect-backend.onrender.com

